[MLA.JOUR.DIG.01] Source: Unit 5 Digital Publication Scenario. Project: The journalism staff is preparing a final online package called New Student Guide. Required parts: a digital presentation explaining three key findings, a sequential image strip showing how to find student services, an accurate feature photo, a revised article, and an online publication page. Team Needs: the package must be cohesive, visually accurate, captioned, reviewed, exported, submitted on time, and appropriate for new students and families. Production Risk: one image is outdated, one caption is vague, the article needs final revision, and the team has two days before publication. Question: Unit Assessment Question 17: Which answer best applies Unit 5 digital journalism skills to the New Student Guide package? {
